MapName=Portal defense
Task=Repel all monster attacks
Brief_1_1=The portal has been stabilized, and messages have finally begun to arrive. This island is teeming with aggressive monsters, the previous group has disappeared and resources are almost exhausted. We must protect the portal until the lost group returns.
Brief_1_2=Now the portal allows us to teleport more unicorns, speed up their teleportation and protect all base buildings with a shield, including towers. This will be very useful in defense.
Brief_2=I feel the enemies approaching. Get ready!
Brief_3=Another group of monsters on the way!
Brief_4=Many enemies nearby. Keep the line, protect the portal!
Brief_Final=The lost unicorns are back. We all go to the portal, there is nothing else to do here!
